{"id":"m6-030","m":6,"paper":"2016年上海市行政执法类考试《行测》试题（网友回忆版）","region":"上海","year":2016,"q":2,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":"<p>        2012年，测绘地理信息系统完成测绘服务总值74.92亿元，同比增长15.6%。测绘地理信息系统人均测绘服务总值（人均测绘服务总值<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1b02ecc8991272df.png\" />）达到292509元，增长17.4%。</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1894e41c4e81c05.png\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1894e3af2f24987.png\" /></p>","qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"5703430","tag":"增长","type":"single","stem":"2007-2012年间，测绘服务总值同比增速最快的年份，其服务总值比上一年约增加了        亿元。","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"9"},{"k":"B","t":"10"},{"k":"C","t":"12"},{"k":"D","t":"14"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"根据题干“······比上一年约增加了······亿元”，可判定本题为增长量计算问题。定位统计图1可知，2007-2012年间，测绘服务总值同比增速最快的年份是2011年。根据公式：增长量=现期量-基期量，则2011年测绘服务总值的同比增量=64.79-50.74=14.05亿元，与D项最接近。\n故正确答案为D。"}]},{"material":"<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1894e43c45c708b.png\" /></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1894e43dce2d05d.png\" /></p>","qs":[{"n":2,"qid":"5703514","tag":"增长","type":"single","stem":"以下        项折线图能准确反映2011-2014年浙江省25-50岁人口同比增速的变化趋势。","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1894e3c4024eb6c.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1894e3c5eb08d6d.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1894e3c77e34e16.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E9%A2%98%E7%9B%AE%E5%9B%BE/1894e3c8c183cff.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题干“······能准确反映······同比增速的变化趋势”，可判定本题为一般增长率问题。定位统计表1可得：2010-2014年，浙江省25-50岁人口数量。根据公式：增长率<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9ad7a88fa1bfefd7.png\" />，可得2011年浙江省25-50岁人口数量同比增速为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6f66aa6348008746.png\" />，观察选项，只有B项满足。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"}]}]}